# Nothing in here belongs on daag-bd.com.
#
# design-directions/ matters most: twelve of those prototypes contain
# FABRICATED archive entries with invented quotes and invented DG-2026-xxxx
# reference numbers. Vercel serves any .html at its own path, so without this
# file they would be publicly reachable at daag-bd.com/design-directions/...
# Fake abuse records sitting on a real abuse archive is not a cosmetic problem.

design-directions/
facebook/
motion/
Essentials/
content social media/

# Working files
.DS_Store
*.log

# The schema lives in the repo as the source of truth for the database.
# It is applied in the Supabase SQL editor, never served to a browser.
migrations/

# Build scripts. Not secret, but a .py file has no business being served
# from the document root.
tools/

# Internal planning documents. All three were serving at 200 on daag-bd.com:
#   /persona.md  /daag-project-documentation.md  /user-journey.md
*.md

# Google Cloud service-account private key for the GA4 reporting function.
# .gitignore already keeps it out of the repo, so a Git deploy never sees it.
# This is here so a `vercel deploy` from a developer's machine cannot upload it
# either -- the CLI packs the working directory, not the commit.
daag-bd-*.json
*-service-account*.json

# Working notes from the SEO audit. Not part of the site.
critique/
